// `ui.*` — the unified authoring surface. Combines the previous `sui.*`
// (SUI compiler analysis) and `view.*` (view authoring writes) into one
// domain, plus a new component-discovery service. The domain name is
// `ship.ui` because "sui" = "Ship User Interface" and the authoring side
